  "summary": "BACnet variables for WaterFurnace Envision 1-6 ton water-to-air heat pumps. The BAS can command occupancy and let the controller hold its occupied/unoccupied setpoints, or send G, Y1, Y2 and O calls directly. Unit statuses are binary inputs in this version, and ECM fan speeds, passive dehumidification, sensor type and fan cycling are set through writable values.",
