  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "The sheet labels the multistate values 'Type 15'; standard BACnet uses type 19 for Multistate Value, so they are listed here as MV.",
    "The sheet does not name the controller or say which points are flash-backed; WaterFurnace's FX10 sheets for similar units store AV/MV points in flash.",
    "MO2-MO5 and MO8 have no state texts in the sheet; MO10 Dehum Cmd has no description.",
    "No engineering units are printed in the source; temperatures are presumably degrees F.",
    "Alarm codes 5-7 are not listed.",
    "The sheet does not state the BACnet transport."
  ],
